驗證 View 產出的行業別資料是否與 WBS 來源表一致，可以透過以下幾組 SQL 進行比對與防呆檢查：
1. 抽樣比對單一客戶的欄位值（最直接）
找幾筆具代表性的客戶 ID（例如個人戶、法人戶、行業代碼為空補 999999 的資料），直接比對 View 與來源表：
USE [MYDB];
GO

DECLARE @CustID VARCHAR(50) = 'MY2199999'; -- 替換為實際測試的 CustomerID

-- 查詢 View 產出的結果
SELECT 
    CustomerID,
    CustomerType,
    SIC_Code,
    OccupationCode,
    OWNERSHIP_CODE
FROM dbo.Preload_Customer
WHERE CustomerID = @CustID;

-- 比對 WBS 來源表的原始值
SELECT 
    CIF.CUSTOMER_ID,
    CIF.LOCAL_INDUSTRY_CODE   AS [WBS_LOCAL_INDUSTRY_CODE],
    CIF.BUSINESS_SECTOR_CODE  AS [WBS_BUSINESS_SECTOR_CODE],
    KYC.OCCUPATION            AS [WBS_KYC_OCCUPATION]
FROM dbo.WBS_CIF_CUST_INFO CIF
LEFT JOIN dbo.WBS_CIF_KYC KYC 
    ON CIF.CIF_KYC_SEQ = KYC.CIF_KYC_SEQ 
   AND KYC.STATUS = '1'
WHERE CIF.CUSTOMER_ID = @CustID;

2. 全量比對不一致筆數（驗證邏輯完整性）
檢查整張 View 與 WBS 原始表是否存在對應落差（理論上查詢結果應該為 0 筆）：
USE [MYDB];
GO

SELECT 
    V.CustomerID,
    V.SIC_Code          AS View_SIC_Code,
    ISNULL(CIF.LOCAL_INDUSTRY_CODE, '999999') AS Expected_SIC_Code,
    V.OccupationCode    AS View_OccupationCode,
    KYC.OCCUPATION      AS Expected_OccupationCode,
    V.OWNERSHIP_CODE    AS View_OWNERSHIP_CODE,
    CIF.BUSINESS_SECTOR_CODE AS Expected_OWNERSHIP_CODE
FROM dbo.Preload_Customer V
JOIN dbo.WBS_CIF_CUST_INFO CIF 
    ON V.CustomerID = CIF.CUSTOMER_ID
LEFT JOIN dbo.WBS_CIF_KYC KYC 
    ON CIF.CIF_KYC_SEQ = KYC.CIF_KYC_SEQ 
   AND KYC.STATUS = '1'
WHERE 
    V.SIC_Code <> ISNULL(CIF.LOCAL_INDUSTRY_CODE, '999999')
    OR ISNULL(V.OccupationCode, '') <> ISNULL(KYC.OCCUPATION, '')
    OR ISNULL(V.OWNERSHIP_CODE, '') <> ISNULL(CIF.BUSINESS_SECTOR_CODE, '');

3. 檢查常見邊界異常情境
 * 預設補值 999999 筆數：
   SELECT COUNT(*) AS Default_SIC_Count 
FROM dbo.Preload_Customer 
WHERE SIC_Code = '999999';

 * 法人戶（N）是否帶有個人職業代碼（OccupationCode）（確認業務邏輯是否合理）：
   SELECT CustomerID, CustomerType, OccupationCode 
FROM dbo.Preload_Customer 
WHERE CustomerType = 'N' AND OccupationCode IS NOT NULL;

